    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>Passionate senior software engineer who genuinely enjoys building high-quality, maintainable systems — and the discipline required to keep them that way. I’ve extracted and owned bounded contexts from monoliths, shortened release cycles, and raised the bar on CI/CD along the way. I love learning, building knowledge bases, and leaving codebases cleaner than I found them.</p>"
